{"parse": {"title": "未知种根骨", "pageid": 2214, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"未知种根骨\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/31/Item-110302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"未知种根骨\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>未知种根骨</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#110302</div></div><hr /><div>相对完整的骨头，来自不同的生物骨架。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">虽然不如完整的骨架那样拥有高品质，但是从使用性价比来看，腿骨、肋骨与残次的颅骨总是最优解。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">仓库·<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/481006\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E9%98%B6%E7%A7%98%E7%89%A9%E5%8C%A3%E5%AD%90\" title=\"中阶秘物匣子\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E9%98%B6%E7%A7%98%E7%89%A9%E5